  "contentHtml": "<p>코로나 이전 유전 수업에서&#160;</p><p>4명이서 한 개조가 되어 시계방향으로 돌면서 얼굴의 각 부위를 그리게 하였습니다.</p><p>A학생: 얼굴형</p><p>B학생: 코</p><p>C학생: 콧구멍</p><p>D학생: 인중&#160; &#160;등등등...</p><p>이렇게 하나씩 그리면서 4명의 유전 정보를 합친 가상의 자손을 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p>그리고 미러링으로 공유하여 학생들과 공유하였습니다. 보면서 학생들과 많이 웃었네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/887500e5bd5f839dd94bff94afe42cd8b68f5bff\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/887500e5bd5f839dd94bff94afe42cd8b68f5bff\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c804020daafd9065ce3b250c15e7781adde0bc0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c804020daafd9065ce3b250c15e7781adde0bc0\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93e1f7fe3047a91301b5ea2c381f3add1c435e3d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93e1f7fe3047a91301b5ea2c381f3add1c435e3d\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eb601d2397d34b768aa014dc7d10dedaa33fd6d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3eb601d2397d34b768aa014dc7d10dedaa33fd6d\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
